# .env.example — a TEMPLATE, safe to commit. Contains no real key.
#
# HOW TO USE THIS FILE
# -------------------
# 1. Get a free key at  https://aistudio.google.com/apikey  (sign in, "Create API key").
# 2. Copy this file and rename the copy to  .env
#       Windows PowerShell:   Copy-Item .env.example .env
# 3. Open .env and paste your key after the = sign, with no quotes and no spaces.
# 4. Never commit .env — .gitignore already blocks it.
#
# WHAT HAPPENS IF YOU SKIP THIS
# -----------------------------
# Nothing breaks. agent/language.py falls back to its offline word-matching parser
# and the app clearly displays "offline mode - no AI used". The other eight stages
# are plain Python and do not need a key at all.

GEMINI_API_KEY=paste-your-key-here
